/// |   0   |   1   |   0   |   0   | ADC4               |
/// |   0   |   1   |   0   |   1   | ADC5               |
/// |   0   |   1   |   1   |   0   | ADC6               |
/// |   0   |   1   |   1   |   1   | ADC7               |
/// |   1   |   0   |   0   |   0   | ADC8               |
